<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia edges up to 1.8730 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia edges up to 1.8730 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia edged up to 1.8730 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange from 1,8755 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    February 3	   January 31</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar	  1.8730		 1.8755</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $950,000	     $7.82 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
